            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "What makes it work",
            "heading_bottom_content": "",
            "content": "<p>Evening Stillness works by engaging the senses most closely tied to relaxation — scent, touch, and breath.<br/><br/>The formulation combines grounding botanical extracts and essential oils traditionally used to calm the mind and ease the body into rest.<br/><br/>Rather than forcing sleep, the ritual supports the nervous system's natural ability to transition into stillness.<br/><br/>Consistency matters more than intensity. This is why the ritual is designed to be repeated gently, every evening.</p>"
